CREATE TRIGGER JurnalTransInsert ON JurnalTrans FOR INSERT AS DECLARE @MID      INT DECLARE @VSLastId INT SELECT  @MID=TransID from Inserted SELECT @VSLastId=LastID from TablesID WHERE TablesID.TableName='JurnalTrans' IF @MID > @VSLastId BEGIN  RETURN END  Insert Operations (OperationID, OperationType, OperationTable)  SELECT Inserted.TransID, 'Insert' AS OperationType , 'JurnalTrans' AS OperationTable From Inserted 